<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Noble Drilling upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Noble Drilling upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer said it upgraded Noble Drilling Corp to outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Noble gained 1/8 to 18-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
